{"id":"derjenige","lemma":"derjenige","pos":"pron","rank":1390,"glosses":["he (who)","the one","this one, that one"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/ca/De-derjenige.ogg/De-derjenige.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"diejenigen"},"examples":[{"text":"Du bist derjenige, den ich mag.","en":"You're the one I like.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/757286","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"}]},{"text":"Sie sind diejenigen, die gehen wollen.","en":"They're the ones who want to go.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"to go, to walk"},{"g":"to want"}]},{"text":"Ich bin derjenige, der krank ist.","en":"I'm the one who's sick.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759415","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"ill, sick"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Ihr seid diejenigen, die verwirrt sind.","en":"It's you who are confused.","words":[{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"confused"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Ich bin derjenige, den sie wollen.","en":"I'm the one they want.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to want"}]}]}